{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787030374824744001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"postmodern-tangled-mollusk","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"b0f254be1043e529da26dd20c00c217e0b01ee4f6bfe60e633f1998bb1612f5f","event_uuid":"354083d1-51d5-4dbe-a884-fbd365aa4a8f","position":{"commit_sha":"8dca9f9a4d327a2998503f9323044ecbf5cb6d78","position":"1787028466987207001-354083d1-51d5-4dbe-a884-fbd365aa4a8f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"7b4e965ae5c61eb2faa5718732b869bad928b759430a2f725b801bc3c84d1873","event_uuid":"cd113786-c321-47a6-8e35-94be1ab43c81","position":{"commit_sha":"f32968bfac16346b442aafce5adae18cb3c82d89","position":"1787028481532710001-cd113786-c321-47a6-8e35-94be1ab43c81"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"a6321ae0dbe333a3338153f6635bb149394b90c8aa8ce5b8cde6d7c1a355cbf1","event_uuid":"a99befbb-e385-4d7e-8adc-8218fa60bf27","position":{"commit_sha":"5e6ef9c5cf43df2bd6d3553395e5c4d5e3bb943c","position":"1787028486654213001-a99befbb-e385-4d7e-8adc-8218fa60bf27"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787028466987207001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context\nOnce coordinator results are authoritative, preview/log/manifest consumers need a stable additive contract and state must advance only for proven postconditions. Deferred or ambiguous work cannot be reported as applied.\n\n## Outcome\nFinalize versioned lifecycle/retry/fuse outcome sections, exact pass tallies/cursor behavior, and redacted bounded diagnostics while preserving existing mutation fields.\n\n## Plan\n1. Render versioned lifecycle intents, logical/physical attempts, delay source/value, budget, failure scope, disposition, `retry_not_before`, fuse state, and exact ticket/pass outcomes.\n2. Preserve the existing mutation fields/array/hash and make additive sections ignorable by older readers.\n3. Advance cursor, baseline, binding, and last-pass state only after proven postconditions. Deferred, failed, skipped, and `commit_unknown` work stays eligible for later re-observation.\n4. Pin applied/failed/deferred/skipped/recovered tallies and exit semantics for mixed passes and delivery failure.\n5. Redact secrets and bound every diagnostic field and collection.\n\n## Testing\nGolden preview/log/manifest fixtures cover every disposition and mixed pass. State spies assert exact writes and next-pass eligibility.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Existing mutation fields, array bytes, and canonical hash remain unchanged.\n- [ ] Additive versioned output includes every named lifecycle/retry/fuse/outcome field.\n- [ ] Cursor, baseline, and binding state advance only for proven postconditions.\n- [ ] Deferred, failed, skipped, and `commit_unknown` work is not counted as applied and remains eligible next pass.\n- [ ] Mixed-pass tallies and exit status are exact.\n- [ ] Logs and manifests contain no secret or unbounded diagnostic content.\n\n## Out of scope\nRoute removal and portable end-to-end/documentation completion.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/manifest_renderer.py","reason":"Seal versioned lifecycle, retry, fuse, and outcome output."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/reconcile.py","reason":"Advance state and exit status from proven coordinator outcomes."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/last_pass.py","reason":"Persist exact deferred, failed, and recovered pass semantics."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_preview_lifecycle_intents.py","reason":"Golden additive preview and redaction contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_bridge_canonical_manifest.py","reason":"Existing mutation field and hash compatibility."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_live_mode_failure_tally.py","reason":"State advancement, exact tally, and exit regressions."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","3350-90b1-2651-4c50"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"3350-90b1-2651-4c50","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["rp03","manifest","reconciler","tdd"],"ticket_id":"0f5d-2a24-91d2-4148","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-03 S5 T2 — Seal versioned outcomes and proven-state advancement","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_preview_lifecycle_intents.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_bridge_canonical_manifest.py","dd_id":"AC1-AC2,AC6","dd_text":"Mutation compatibility, additive versioned output, and bounded redaction"},{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_live_mode_failure_tally.py","dd_id":"AC3-AC5","dd_text":"Proven-only state advancement, next-pass eligibility, exact tallies, and exit"}]},"source_event_uuids":["354083d1-51d5-4dbe-a884-fbd365aa4a8f","cd113786-c321-47a6-8e35-94be1ab43c81","a99befbb-e385-4d7e-8adc-8218fa60bf27"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787030374824744001,"uuid":"3a386914-a50c-4286-a55b-1ab2c99f0898"}